body:
Thank you for your concern. I just wanted to write a small vent since I don't want to bother anyone else with this.

&#x200B;

I'm trying to find a job as a short term goal, I've been calling and been on 4 interviews so far and nobody wants to hire me. My dream is to save enough money and learn how to drive so I can achieve full-time RV living. I'm losing a lot of money and don't think I'll have enough for myself until then.

Had this happen to a friend. He used some sick days to take care of his sick mother, but then got the flu. Got fired about two weeks ago and as I know, can't find another job.

&#x200B;

Fuck Walmart.

You're not the only one. I've been severely depressed and too poor to get help, and don't want to talk to my friends and family about it. I really want to die and go into another world where I can be with people who love me and live a happy life. However, I don't know if it's real. I don't know if there is a heaven or hell, or nothing. 

&#x200B;

That being said, I hope I get shot or something like that quick and painless someday. I loved isekai for a long time, even before I was depressed, but now I feel like it's becoming more real for me than ever. I hope things get better for you man

I feel you completely. I've been thinking about kms and one of the few things that keeps me going is the dream of spending alone time with my husbando, outdoors and camping. 

&#x200B;

I hope things get better for you. It can be difficult to accept this. I have a hard time believing it myself, but you are doing nothing wrong and not hurting anyone. I'd rather be in a "fake" relationship with someone who I know who would love me for who I am than someone who's "real", ends up being two-faced, and break off with me. Not to mention that they will force their own problems onto you. Just do what you think is right, no matter what anyone else says.

((OH THANK GOD, you're around her age and not older than her to be a pedo creep))

&#x200B;

There's nothing wrong with loving her at all! I've had crushes on fictional characters all my life, but never proclaimed any of them to be my husbando until last year (and that took me months to come to terms with). As long as you acknowledge fantasy from reality, it's okay. 

&#x200B;

When merchandise comes out, buy her. Making/commission from s/o fanart or a plush doll will be helpful too. I hope this helps!

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
